&lt;p data-type=&quot;unstyled&quot; data-id=&quot;a6b8c301-2390-453b-a5eb-e526a94dca3c&quot;&gt;If there are any adjustments or accommodations that we can make to assist you during the recruitment process and your journey at Karbon, contact us at ----- for a confidential discussion. Please note that, due to the volume, emails sent to this email address that are not for adjustments or accommodations will not receive a response.&lt;/p&gt;
